# Ignore everything by default
*

# IMPORTANT:
# - This repo uses an allowlist below to decide what is tracked.
# - If you add a new top-level folder that should be versioned, add it to the allowlist.
#
# But track these specific folders
!src/
!configs/
!docs/
!ops/
!repo_lifecycle/
!scripts/
!manifests/
!openspec/
!reference/
!vis_tools/
!tests/
!public_data/
!progress/
!research/
!.planning/
!README.md

# Track files in the tracked folders
!src/**
!configs/**
!docs/**/*
!ops/**
!repo_lifecycle/**
!scripts/**
!manifests/**
!openspec/**
!reference/**
!vis_tools/**
!tests/**
!.cursorignore
!.cursorindexingignore
!pytest.ini
!*.md
!public_data/**/
!public_data/**/*.py
!public_data/**/*.md
!public_data/**/*.sh
!progress/**
!research/**
!.planning/**

# Hard local-only workspace roots. These patterns are intentionally explicit
# even though the repo uses an allowlist, so future allowlist edits do not
# accidentally surface runtime state, secrets, checkpoints, or external clones.
/output/
/outputs/
/output_remote/
/tb/
/vis_out/
/result/
/monitor_dumps/
/model_cache/
/model_cache_remote/
/external/
/baidupcsgo/
/agent_discussion/
/coco_bbox_*merged/
/.claude/
/.gemini/
/.gitnexus/
/.history/
/.proxy/
/.vendor/
/.worktrees/
/.mcp.json
/baidu_net_cookie.txt
/github_personal_token.txt
/claude_install.sh
/(deleted)

# Serena project memories (track these, keep other .serena/* ignored)
!.serena/
!.serena/memories/
!.serena/memories/**

# Shared self-improving memory for this workspace
!.self-improving/
!.self-improving/**

# Codex skills are tracked; local memories and plugin caches stay per-environment
!.codex/
!.codex/agents/
!.codex/agents/**
!.codex/skills/
!.codex/skills/**
.codex/.tmp/
.codex/app-server-control/
.codex/auth.json*
.codex/cache/
.codex/config.toml*
.codex/huggingface/
.codex/log/
.codex/logs/
.codex/logs_*.sqlite*
.codex/memories/
.codex/plugins/
.codex/plugins/cache/
.codex/prompts/
.codex/remote-control.log
.codex/session_index.jsonl
.codex/sessions/
.codex/shell_snapshots/
.codex/state_*.sqlite*
.codex/superpowers/
.codex/tmp/
.codex/vendor_imports/
# Ignore downloaded/installed skill system runtime artifacts
.codex/skills/.system/

# Ignore common Python cache folders
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.pyd
**/.Python
**/build/
**/develop-eggs
**/dist/
**/downloads/
**/eggs/
**/.eggs/
**/lib/
**/lib64/
**/parts/
**/sdist/
**/var/
**/wheels/
**/*.egg-info/
**/.installed.cfg
**/*.egg

# Ignore common IDE and system files
**/.DS_Store
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~

# Ignore common temporary files
**/tmp/
**/temp/
**/*.log
**/*.tmp

**/build/
**/dist/
**/target/
**/node_modules/

# Ignore common data and model files
**/*.pkl
**/*.pickle
**/*.h5
**/*.hdf5
**/*.model
**/*.ckpt
**/*.pth
**/*.pt
**/*.bin
**/*.safetensors

# Ignore generated/managed local Codex skill runtime artifacts
text_editor.md
.gitnexus
